{
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/oasis-tcs/sarif-spec/main/sarif-2.1/schema/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "fullName": "Trivy Vulnerability Scanner",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy",
          "name": "Trivy",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-47913",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: SSH client panic due to unexpected SSH_AGENT_SUCCESS"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SSH clients receiving SSH_AGENT_SUCCESS when expecting a typed response will panic and cause early termination of the client process."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-47913",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2025-47913\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: golang.org/x/crypto\nFixed Version: 0.43.0\nLink: [CVE-2025-47913](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-47913)\nSSH clients receiving SSH_AGENT_SUCCESS when expecting a typed response will panic and cause early termination of the client process.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2025-47913**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|golang.org/x/crypto|0.43.0|[CVE-2025-47913](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2025-47913)|\n\nSSH clients receiving SSH_AGENT_SUCCESS when expecting a typed response will panic and cause early termination of the client process."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "vulnerability",
                  "security",
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-39828",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: Unauthorized command execution via discarded SSH permissions"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "When an SSH server authentication callback returned PartialSuccessError with non-nil Permissions, those permissions were silently discarded, potentially dropping certificate restrictions such as force-command after a second factor succeeded. Returning non-nil Permissions with PartialSuccessError now results in a connection error."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-39828",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-39828\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: golang.org/x/crypto\nFixed Version: 0.52.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-39828](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-39828)\nWhen an SSH server authentication callback returned PartialSuccessError with non-nil Permissions, those permissions were silently discarded, potentially dropping certificate restrictions such as force-command after a second factor succeeded. Returning non-nil Permissions with PartialSuccessError now results in a connection error.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-39828**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|golang.org/x/crypto|0.52.0|[CVE-2026-39828](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-39828)|\n\nWhen an SSH server authentication callback returned PartialSuccessError with non-nil Permissions, those permissions were silently discarded, potentially dropping certificate restrictions such as force-command after a second factor succeeded. Returning non-nil Permissions with PartialSuccessError now results in a connection error."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "vulnerability",
                  "security",
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-39835",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: golang: golang.org/x/crypto/ssh: Denial of Service via crafted SSH certificate"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SSH servers which use CertChecker as a public key callback without setting IsUserAuthority or IsHostAuthority could be caused to panic by a client presenting a certificate. CertChecker now returns an error instead of panicking when these callbacks are nil."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-39835",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2026-39835\nSeverity: HIGH\nPackage: golang.org/x/crypto\nFixed Version: 0.52.0\nLink: [CVE-2026-39835](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-39835)\nSSH servers which use CertChecker as a public key callback without setting IsUserAuthority or IsHostAuthority could be caused to panic by a client presenting a certificate. CertChecker now returns an error instead of panicking when these callbacks are nil.",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2026-39835**\n| Severity | Package | Fixed Version | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|HIGH|golang.org/x/crypto|0.52.0|[CVE-2026-39835](https://avd.aquasec.com/nvd/cve-2026-39835)|\n\nSSH servers which use CertChecker as a public key callback without setting IsUserAuthority or IsHostAuthority could be caused to panic by a client presenting a certificate. CertChecker now returns an error instead of panicking when these callbacks are nil."
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "very-high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "vulnerability",
                  "security",
                  "HIGH"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-47914",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "golang.org/x/crypto/ssh/agent: SSH Agent servers: Denial of Service due to malformed messages"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "SSH Agent servers do not validate the size of messages when processing new identity requests, which may cause the program to panic if the message is malformed due to an out of bounds read."
